                "message": "Add an Edited works table for pub-editor to the lint and the works commands\n\nThe lint's person pass now adds an Edited works heading and a block\n(pub-editor, leaving out works the person also authored, via the new\n:except-prop spec key). The BibTeX module reads editor fields and links\neditor-only entries with pub-editor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAaYiYrU4FW8BNZKiB",
